# 🕷️ Hexapod Robot Project - AI Assistant Prompt

## Project Overview
You are helping debug and develop a 6-legged hexapod robot with tripod gait locomotion. The project has been migrated from Wemos D1 Mini to ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 and uses a 32-channel servo controller.

## Hardware Configuration

### Main Controller
- **MCU**: ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1
- **Communication**: Serial1 (pins 4,5) to servo controller at 9600 baud
- **Network**: WiFi connection for web-based control interface

### Servo System  
- **Controller**: 32-channel PWM servo controller (RTRobot compatible)
- **Servos**: 18x MG90 micro servos (3 per leg)
- **Pulse Range**: 1000-2000μs (safe range), 1500μs neutral
- **Communication Protocol**: `#<channel>P<pulse>T<time>\r\n`

### Physical Layout
```
       FL(5)     FR(0)
        |   \   /   |
        |    \ /    |  
   ML(4)|     X     |MR(1)
        |    / \    |
        |   /   \   |
       RL(3)     RR(2)

Legend: FR=Front Right, FL=Front Left, MR=Middle Right, 
        ML=Middle Left, RR=Rear Right, RL=Rear Left
```

